  "description": "Command-line tool for GDSII, OASIS and DXF layout files: inspect, dump, validate, convert between any two, run booleans, check against a design rule deck, trace nets, measure, and export SVG or a 3D model (STL, OBJ, GLTF, GLB) with each layer at its own height from a layermap. `gds mcp` lets an AI model such as Claude open, draw on, edit, check and save the layouts in one folder, through the Model Context Protocol.",
